{"id": "a10a988922243366", "field": "text", "it": "Eva, ho perso la Spectral Essence. Me ne serve un'altra.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g04-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "a10a988922243366", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "a111acf490e5e8b4", "field": "text", "it": "Allenati duramente, allenati ogni giorno. E quando avrai perfezionato le tue abilità, torna da me.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g10-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "a111acf490e5e8b4", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "a118f0ffcf767521", "field": "text", "it": "Thrall ha mostrato grande bontà concedendomi asilo nel suo dominio. In ogni caso, non voglio abusare della sua ospitalità. Sarebbe un grande disonore portare guai al nostro capo.", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g10-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "a118f0ffcf767521", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "a11b47ad7b8317da", "field": "text", "it": "Salute, {class}. Sei qui per apprendere le arti occulte?", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g00-sg2@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "a11b47ad7b8317da", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": "a11e30da2ad5ceef", "field": "text", "it": "Sissignora!", "status": "trusted", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-g30-sg3@2026-10-22", "imported": "2026-10-22"}, "english": {"hash": "a11e30da2ad5ceef", "src": "gossip-key@normalize_v1"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
